ates that the O’Connor Center offers memberships to students and that a membership application must be completed before entering.","source_url":"https://students.jhu.edu/student-life/get-involved/oconnor-center-for-recreation-well-being/memberships-services/","source_title":"Membership Services | JHU Student Affairs","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Active membership and a completed application are required before entry; it is not open to the general community for membership.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-homewood-field","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Homewood Field","title":"Catch a Blue Jays home game","subtitle":"Homewood Campus athletics venue","notes":"Check the current athletics schedule, then attend a home competition with friends and use the walk back across campus to compare weekend plans.","short_summary":"A campus-based spectator option when a home competition is scheduled.","evidence_claim":"JHU Student Well-Being states that all Hopkins home athletics competitions, including lacrosse, are free for students and held on the Homewood campus.","source_url":"https://wellbeing.jhu.edu/blog/2021/11/03/why-joining-the-flock-is-good-for-your-health/","source_title":"Why joining “The Flock” is good for your health | JHU Student Well-Being","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2021-11-03","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Only applicable when a home competition is scheduled; the cited free entry applies to JHU students.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"jhu-freshman-quad","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Freshman Quad","title":"End on Freshman Quad","subtitle":"Homewood Campus quad","notes":"Use the quad as a final outdoor meet-up point, then make a simple plan for the week ahead before heading back to your residence or next event.","short_summary":"A recognizable Homewood gathering point for a relaxed weekend wrap-up.","evidence_claim":"JHU Student Affairs identifies Freshman Quad as the location for campus activities including its Well-Being Day programming.","source_url":"https://wellbeing.jhu.edu/blog/2024/09/04/well-being-day-2024/","source_title":"Well-Being Day 2024 | Johns Hopkins University Student Well-Being","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2024-09-04","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor campus space; availability can change for scheduled programs or maintenance.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
